      "voice": "../../common/voice/AR02_detail_tw.mp3"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "name": "內裏",
    "name_path": "../../common/images/AR/_zh-TW/02_img_AR_label_03_zh_TW.png",
    "building_path": "../../common/images/AR/AR03_building.jpg",
    "detail": {
      "image_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_header_03.png",
      "label_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_img_header_03_txt_zh_TW.png",
      "name_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_img_txt_title_03_zh_TW.png",
      "period": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_img_icon_early_zh_TW.png",
      "text": "內裏是天皇日常生活的場所，也是處理政事的場所。在後來的宮殿中，被配置在遠離大極殿院和朝堂院的北面，但在前期難波宮中，朝堂院的廣闊空間一直延伸到作為內裏正門的內裏南門的南側。內裏南門寬為七柱間（約32.7公尺），是古代宮殿中最大的門。 據推測，應該是按照傳統宮殿建築風格建造，採用有掘立柱式，板葺式屋頂。",
      "photo_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_photo_03.png",
      "photo_text_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_txt_photo_03_zh_TW.png",
      "voice": "../../common/voice/AR03_detail_tw.mp3"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "name": "八角殿",
    "name_path": "../../common/images/AR/_zh-TW/02_img_AR_label_04_zh_TW.png",
    "building_path": "../../common/images/AR/AR04_building.jpg",
    "detail": {
      "image_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_header_04.png",
      "label_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_img_header_04_txt_zh_TW.png",
      "name_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_img_txt_title_04_zh_TW.png",
      "period": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_img_icon_early_zh_TW.png",
      "text": "八角殿位於內裏南門的東西兩側，發掘研究結果表明，內部柱子採用柱孔一側斜向挖寬的特殊方式豎立，由此推測其外觀為多層建築，高近15公尺。關於其用途眾說紛紜，但有人認為八角形樓閣建築的用途是為了使宮殿中心更加莊嚴，體現出濃烈的中國大陸宮殿建築思想。",
      "photo_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_photo_04.png",
      "photo_text_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_txt_photo_04_zh_TW.png",
      "voice": "../../common/voice/AR04_detail_tw.mp3"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "name": "大極殿院",
    "name_path": "../../common/images/AR/_zh-TW/02_img_AR_label_05_zh_TW.png",
    "building_path": "../../common/images/AR/AR05_building.jpg",
    "detail": {
      "image_path": "../../common/images/info/03_img_header_05.png",
      "label_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_img_header_00-05_txt_zh_TW.png",
      "name_path": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_img_txt_title_05_zh_TW.png",
      "period": "../../common/images/info/_zh-TW/03_img_icon_late_zh_TW.png",
      "text": "大極殿院在由莊嚴的複廊環繞的空間中，建有後期難波宮殿最重要的建築大極殿和大極殿後殿。大極殿正面約42公尺、深約21公尺，建於石造基壇上，屋頂為瓦葺式，柱子塗成紅色，可以推測其為具有中國風格的外觀。 屋簷採用圖案簡單的重圈文瓦當、板瓦。 臣民在新年拜見天皇以及外國使節覲見等舉行國家儀式時，天皇端坐在大極殿中央的「高御座」上。",
